flowchart TB
  accTitle: Pequeverso private backoffice components and boundaries
  accDescr: Invited operators authenticate using OAuth and private PostgreSQL. Server session and role guards protect the dashboard. A bounded server adapter reads API summary and optional telemetry, separate from private observability.
  Operator["INVITED OPERATOR<br/>Private application access"] --> Guard["SERVER ACCESS BOUNDARY<br/>Better Auth OAuth · session / role guard<br/>PostgreSQL identity · sessions · invitations"]
  Guard --> Panel["PEQUEVERSO DASHBOARD<br/>Health · catalog · runs · latency · spend"]
  Panel --> Adapter["SERVER ADAPTER<br/>Bounded · validated · private bearer"]
  Adapter --> Summary["API SUMMARY · REVISION1.2<br/>API-owned SQLite aggregates"]
  Adapter -. "Optional · same bearer" .-> Telemetry["API TELEMETRY · REVISION1.0<br/>Point-in-time process readings"]
  Panel -. "Separate private integration" .-> Monitor["VPS-OPS OBSERVABILITY<br/>OTLP instrumentation · OFF by default<br/>Separate metrics bearer → Prometheus → Grafana"]
  Monitor ~~~ Legend["KEY · Solid: implemented path<br/>Dashed: OFF, optional or future · read labels"]
  class Operator person
  class Guard,Panel,Adapter app
  class Summary,Telemetry data
  class Monitor,Legend external
  classDef person fill:#423620,stroke:#a6c5ed,color:#f4f5f8,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef app fill:#1c3049,stroke:#a6c5ed,color:#f4f5f8,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef data fill:#183b3b,stroke:#77d3c4,color:#f4f5f8,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef external fill:#253144,stroke:#9baac0,color:#f4f5f8,stroke-width:1.2px,stroke-dasharray:4 3;
